                                                                                                    class="wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                                    style="font-family:madefor-display,helveticaneuew01-45ligh,helveticaneuew02-45ligh,helveticaneuew10-45ligh,sans-serif;"><span
                                                                                                        class="wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                                        style="letter-spacing:0.01em;">Using
                                                                                                        your Computer or
                                                                                                        Laptop</span></span></span></span>
                                                                                    </h2>
                                                                                    <h2 class="font_2 wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                        style="font-size:13px; line-height:normal;">
                                                                                        ​<span
                                                                                            class="wixui-rich-text__text">​</span>
                                                                                    </h2>
                                                                                    <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                        style="font-size:14px;">If your
                                                                                        keyboard has a numeric keypad,
                                                                                        you can type Ñ/ñ by following
                                                                                        these steps:</p>
                                                                                    <ol class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                        style="font-size:14px;">
                                                                                        <li
                                                                                            class="wixui-rich-text__text">
                                                                                            <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                                style="font-size:14px;">
                                                                                                Enable the numeric
                                                                                                keypad by turning on the
                                                                                                Num lock key.</p>
                                                                                        </li>
                                                                                        <li
                                                                                            class="wixui-rich-text__text">
                                                                                            <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                                style="font-size:14px;">
                                                                                                Hold the Alt key then
                                                                                                type 164 on the numeric
                                                                                                keypad to create a
                                                                                                lowercase ñ. For the
                                                                                                uppercase Ñ, hold the
                                                                                                Alt key then type 165.
                                                                                            </p>
                                                                                        </li>
                                                                                    </ol>
                                                                                    <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                        style="font-size:14px;">Note
                                                                                        that this would only work if
                                                                                        your computer / laptop has a
                                                                                        numeric keypad located on the
                                                                                        right side of the keyboard.</p>
                                                                                    <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                        style="font-size:14px;"><span
                                                                                            class="wixGuard wixui-rich-text__text">​</span>
                                                                                    </p>
                                                                                    <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                        style="font-size:14px;">To
                                                                                        easily remember, here are the
                                                                                        keyboard shortcuts:</p>
                                                                                    <ul class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                        style="font-size:14px;">
                                                                                        <li
                                                                                            class="wixui-rich-text__text">
                                                                                            <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                                style="font-size:14px;">
                                                                                                ñ - Alt + 164</p>
                                                                                        </li>
                                                                                        <li
                                                                                            class="wixui-rich-text__text">
                                                                                            <p class="font_8 wixui-rich-text__text"
                                                                                                style="font-size:14px;">
                                                                                                Ñ - Alt + 165</p>
                                                                                        </li>
                                                                                    </ul>
